    "html": "<p>A train, initially traveling at a speed of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>, slows down with constant deceleration. After moving <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"160\"></span> m in a straight line, the train’s speed is reduced by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> %. How long does it take the train to reduce its speed by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span> %?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span> s</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6\"></span> s</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8\"></span> s</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> s</li>\n</ol>"
